(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-39","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["第三家派来的[[shepherd|牧羊人]]带着一张[[crisp|简明的]]缺水单，没有长老袍。他说弟子中有人见天上[[comet|彗星]]，便将灾情当凶兆，管水人更如[[bully|恶霸]]封口。[[meanwhile|与此同时]]门内也有病者，不能把他们的水全放空。桌边有人[[mutter|小声抱怨]]，顾衡取下[[armor|护甲]]表明今天不是征服。沈砚承认“所有人立即同量”是[[utopian|空想的]]承诺，要先认真实需求。许庭如[[diplomat|交际家]]一般介绍牧羊人，罗清则[[hug|抱]]过跟来的孩子，先问他喝过没有，不让病情只存在在掌柜的介绍里。","孩子轻声[[hum|哼唱]]，手里有半块[[staple|主食]]饼。第三家的[[oriental|东方式样的]]茶棚刚被烧，代表不肯在大殿[[stall|拖延]]一天。周伯列[[bibliography|参考书目]]，指明支渠图来自哪几册，每村都可索看。新[[coalition|同盟]]的范围要包含这个山门的低屋，不能只容认同者。顾衡[[discreet|谨慎地]]问去年赶工[[bonus|奖金]]，发现还款票夹在殿[[aisle|过道]]的柜里。季禾说那笔钱里也有他所得，别让牧羊人独背旧账。代表听见这一句，才肯把自家旱井图完整摊开。","沈砚不再独自[[brood|沉思]]，将不会写字也能指出井口的[[literacy|读写能力]]问题说明白。门外的[[racket|喧嚷]]很大，他请两村暂等读图。任何修炼份额都不[[immune|豁免]]饮水底线，孤城[[brochure|小册子]]记着第一场停票后的缺水，影响并不[[negligible|微不足道]]。沈砚压住立刻夺钥匙的[[impulse|冲动]]，第三口的用水约终于[[crystallize|具体成形]]：先给病者、家户与牲口留实际量，余水才积气。代表要求高台弟子承担同样的减额，不让普通人又是唯一退步者。顾衡在自己份额旁先签了减字。","大家很[[weary|疲倦]]，许庭这个[[entrepreneur|商业经营者]]仍想趁[[collaboration|协作]]确定唯一供货权。沈砚指出这种[[adverse|不利的]]绑定会重演外埠断供。三路[[junction|交汇口]]需两种来源，不等一家公司提供[[salvation|拯救]]。关口退伍工指着旧[[cannon|火炮]]说不能靠武器催签，罗清请代表[[nominate|推荐]]自己门内会量水的人。许庭许诺“我的粮永远不断”，老人说永远是[[delusion|哄骗]]，季节短约与货价更可靠。这条路的[[renaissance|复兴]]要在米真的交到、钱真的付清以后认，不在今天喊定。","祭司把残图的[[spine|书脊]]撑住，门外一群[[mob|暴民]]想闯进去打截流人，顾衡挡在[[sturdy|结实的]]门槛上，没拔剑。沈砚累得[[dizzy|头晕]]，请[[multitude|众人]]留出退路，代表仍可以拒绝条款，也需承担非法封口的调查。第三口的旧捐契不是[[fake|假造的]]，如岸石上的[[fossil|化石]]一样真，却不说明世代可拦水。那片[[tract|大片土地]]里的井彼此[[interact|相互影响]]，更不能按屋界分水。已[[extinct|废弃的]]独占旧规从新文本中[[slash|删去]]，病者需要的[[thermal|保暖的]]用品仍列真实费用。","一声[[rap|急敲]]让全厅停话，是守闸人报夜雨快来。第三家终于交钥匙，但不是没有条件：缓冲池需先能承洪，井量须三方实测，费用各有上限。沈砚认为这些合理，不能为快而拒绝。他们先签最低饮水的临时条，再将长期条列待复测。围门的人散开，顾衡安排两位无门派身份的守水人收钥匙，不让自己同时握三口。罗清把孩子交还父亲，称今日得到水并不抵销受惊与旧欠药费。最后一把钥匙上还沾着掌心的汗，明早真开闸之前，工队要先试池底。"],"en":["A [[shepherd|shepherd]] brought the third sect’s [[crisp|crisp]] shortage sheet. A [[comet|comet]] omen had helped a water [[bully|bully]] close gates. [[meanwhile|Meanwhile]], patients inside also needed water. People began to [[mutter|mutter]]. Gu removed his [[armor|armor]]. Shen admitted equal immediate quantities were [[utopian|utopian]] without measured need. Xu introduced the man like a [[diplomat|diplomat]]; Luo gave his child a [[hug|hug]] and asked about actual drinking.","The child began to [[hum|hum]] over a [[staple|staple]] cake. An [[oriental|oriental]] tea shelter had burned, so the representative would not [[stall|stall]]. Zhou supplied a [[bibliography|bibliography]] of map sources. The [[coalition|coalition]] must include this sect’s low houses too. Gu made [[discreet|discreet]] inquiries about a work [[bonus|bonus]] recorded in an [[aisle|aisle]] cabinet. Ji admitted his share instead of leaving the shepherd sole blame. The man then opened his full dry-well map.","Shen did not merely [[brood|brood]]; limited [[literacy|literacy]] could not exclude practical testimony. Beyond the [[racket|racket]], no cultivation share was [[immune|immune]] from drinking limits. The city [[brochure|brochure]] recorded consequences far from [[negligible|negligible]]. Restraining an [[impulse|impulse]] to seize keys let terms [[crystallize|crystallize]]: patients, homes and animals first, energy from surplus. The delegate demanded platform disciples reduce shares too. Gu signed his own reduction first.","[[weary|Weary]] people heard Xu, an [[entrepreneur|entrepreneur]], request monopoly from their [[collaboration|collaboration]]. Shen rejected this [[adverse|adverse]] tie. A [[junction|junction]] needed multiple suppliers, not one company’s [[salvation|salvation]]. A retired worker said the old [[cannon|cannon]] could not force signatures. Luo asked delegates to [[nominate|nominate]] measurers. Eternal supply promises were [[delusion|delusion]]; short contracts and actual payment would establish the route’s [[renaissance|renaissance]].","The priest supported a map’s [[spine|spine]]. A [[mob|mob]] tried to attack delegates; Gu held a [[sturdy|sturdy]] doorway without drawing steel. [[dizzy|Dizzy]], Shen requested a path through the [[multitude|multitude]]. The old grant was not [[fake|fake]], as real as a [[fossil|fossil]], but did not grant perpetual obstruction. Wells across the [[tract|tract]] would [[interact|interact]]. They would [[slash|slash]] [[extinct|extinct]] monopoly clauses while retaining actual [[thermal|thermal]] care costs.","A [[rap|rap]] announced approaching rain. The third key arrived with reasonable conditions: flood capacity tested, wells jointly measured and costs limited. They signed an interim drinking minimum, leaving long terms for verification. Gu assigned two ordinary keepers instead of holding all keys himself. Luo returned the child to his father; new water did not erase distress or old medical debts. Before tomorrow’s opening, workers still needed to test the pool floor."]});
